---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
      Hi, I'm Valentine.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      I'm a Product Manager with 7+ years building data-driven products, backed by a technical
      foundation in software engineering and AI research. I started young — at 17, as a machine
      learning data annotator building models to identify cancer-causing pathways — and that
      technical grounding still shapes how I work today: I go deep on data, speak fluently with
      engineers, and move fast on hard problems.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      I've taken products from 0→1 — founding <a href="/projects#love-machine" class="underline hover:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:text-neutral-100">The Love Machine</a> and helping launch January AI's MVP health app — and scaled what already works, spending four years driving growth and monetization at Co-Star Astrology.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/experience"
        class="rounded-md bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-neutral-300"
      >
        See my experience
      </a>
      <a
        href="/projects"
        class="rounded-md border border-neutral-300 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:border-neutral-400 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:hover:border-neutral-600"
      >
        See my projects
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
